sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor user as 买家 (Browser)
    participant web as Web 前端
    participant gateway as API 网关
    participant orderService as 订单服务
    participant paymentApi as 第三方支付
    participant db as 业务数据库

    Note over user,db: [browser] checkout-happy-path-ui — 买家在浏览器完成结算下单、支付并收到实时确认 (SUCCESS)
    user->>web: 打开结算页并加载购物车 [shot: 01-open-checkout.png]
    web->>gateway: [HTTP] GET /api/cart
    gateway-->>web: 200
    gateway->>orderService: [RPC] CartService.GetCart
    orderService-->>gateway: ok
    user->>web: 填写收货地址 [shot: 02-fill-shipping.png]
    user->>web: 点击提交订单并触发支付与落库 [shot: 03-submit-order.png]
    web->>gateway: [HTTP] POST /api/orders
    gateway-->>web: 201
    gateway->>orderService: [RPC] OrderService.CreateOrder
    orderService-->>gateway: ok
    orderService->>db: [DB] INSERT orders
    db-->>orderService: ok
    orderService->>paymentApi: [HTTP] POST /v1/charges
    paymentApi-->>orderService: 200
    orderService->>db: [DB] UPDATE orders
    db-->>orderService: ok
    orderService->>web: [WS] WS order.paid
    web-->>orderService: ok
    user->>web: 页面展示支付成功状态 [shot: 04-order-confirmed.png]

    Note over user,db: [api] checkout-out-of-stock-api — 库存不足时拒绝下单且不写入订单或发起支付 (REJECTED)
    user->>gateway: [HTTP] POST /api/orders
    gateway->>orderService: [RPC] OrderService.CreateOrder
    orderService-->>gateway: OUT_OF_STOCK
    orderService->>db: [DB] SELECT products
    db-->>orderService: ok
    gateway-->>user: 409

    Note over user,db: [api] checkout-anonymous-rejected-api — 未登录用户下单返回 401 (REJECTED)
    user->>gateway: [HTTP] POST /api/orders
    gateway-->>user: 401
